    "Name": "Hunchback HBK-4TD",
    "Details": "The -4TD has one big change from the -4G, the fact that it houses a 350 XL engine core. Also knows as the 'Turbo Hunchback Deluxe', it drops the armoring down to 7 tons and uses an Endo Steel chassis to be able to fit both the massive engine and an extra Medium Laser. Similar to its predecessor, the normal 'Turbo Hunchback', the chassis had to be modified in such a way that replacing the engine core is not possible.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>",
